lculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids came in under 90% of normal for February to March in 42 of the 75 years since 1951. In 2026 so far, the middle ran 8% of normal for February to March and 13% of normal for March to April. The last full year went the other way, with August to September at 176% of normal in 2025. Every grid in the county had its driest year in 1956.</p>"}
